
This is the Logoff Police speaking!

Do not ever drop the carrier again! There is a way to nicely logout
from the BBS without dropping the carrier. Even though most bbs'es
handles a carrier drop as it should, it isn't nice behaviour. So next
time you logout, logout nicely please. It this keeps repeating you will
be banned from the BBS. The Sysop has been notified.

But if this carrier loss was due to a family member lifting the phone
it's ok, but don't let it happen again!

                                      / Yours truely, The Logoff Police
